<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span><span class="current">How it works</span></nav>
    <div class="eyebrow">The buying process</div>
    <h1 class="h1" style="margin-top:8px">From registration<br>to your driveway.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Buying a car sight-unseen only works if the process is honest and the
      paperwork is airtight. Here is exactly how ours runs, start to finish.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
    <div class="steps">
      <% steps.forEach(function (s) { %>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-n mono"><%= s.n %></div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="h3 mb-1"><%= s.title %></h2>
            <p style="line-height:1.7"><%= s.body %></p>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:10px"><%= s.detail %></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% }); %>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-pad mt-5" style="border-left:4px solid var(--accent)">
      <h2 class="h3 mb-2">The part most auctions get wrong</h2>
      <p style="line-height:1.72">
        On most platforms you win a car and then wait days for someone to email you
        a contract. We generate your purchase agreement the moment you place a bid —
        already filled in with your name, your address, the VIN and stock number,
        and your bid amount. Sign it whenever suits you.
      </p>
      <p style="line-height:1.72;margin-top:12px">
        If you win, delivery is arranged the same day because the paperwork is
        already done. If you are outbid, the agreement simply never takes effect
        and you owe nothing.
      </p>
      <div class="row mt-3">
        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-inline">Create your account</a>
        <a href="/faq" class="btn btn-ghost btn-inline">Read the FAQ</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-2 mt-5">
      <div class="card card-pad">
        <span style="color:var(--accent-ink)"><%- include('../partials/icons', { icon: 'gavel', strokeWidth: 1.6 }) %></span>
        <h3 class="h4" style="margin:12px 0 8px">Bidding rules in brief</h3>
        <ul class="stack small muted" style="--stack-gap:9px">
          <li>· Highest verified bid at close wins, provided any reserve is met.</li>
          <li>· Minimum raise is <%= money.formatShort(brand.auction.defaultIncrement) %> unless the listing states otherwise.</li>
          <li>· A bid in the last <%= brand.auction.antiSnipeWindowMin %> minutes extends the auction by <%= brand.auction.antiSnipeExtendMin %> minutes.</li>
          <li>· Maximum bids are executed automatically, one increment at a time.</li>
          <li>· Bids are binding and cannot normally be retracted.</li>
          <li>· No buyer premium and no doc fee is charged on any vehicle.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-pad">
        <span style="color:var(--accent-ink)"><%- include('../partials/icons', { icon: 'rotate', strokeWidth: 1.6 }) %></span>
        <h3 class="h4" style="margin:12px 0 8px">After delivery</h3>
        <ul class="stack small muted" style="--stack-gap:9px">
          <li>· Inspection opens 9:00 AM the weekday after delivery.</li>
          <li>· <%= brand.terms.inspectionDays %> days to have your own mechanic assess the vehicle.</li>
          <li>· Limited to <%= brand.terms.maxInspectionMiles %> miles beyond the odometer at sale.</li>
          <li>· Not as described? We collect at our cost, refund in <%= brand.terms.refundWindowHours %>h.</li>
          <li>· <%= brand.terms.warrantyMonths %>-month warranty follows the inspection window.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
